{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/96442-any-hope-of-more-books","id":96442,"title":"Any Hope of More Books?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-22T11:35:56-07:00","id":96442,"title":"Any Hope of More Books?","content":"This is a fun game, and I await the Enlightenment Era game eagerly. But anymore modern books? Howabout Changelings around the world book? Why not Genre books? Give the Changelings a Lovecraft spin and they're great for Space Opera (Yes I have the Infinate Macabre but Sci Fi is vaster than space Opera). Why not a Pirate book for the Historical game and a 20's-30's gangster game? There are many possiblities.<br /> <br /> Any Hope?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-22T12:44:12-07:00","id":96485,"title":"","content":"I fully expect a full Chronicle book next year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-22T12:47:42-07:00","id":96489,"title":"","content":"I'm hopeful we will see more books.","signature":"<hr class=